## Summary
Canadian Minister of Internal Trade Dominic LeBlanc stated that Canada may announce retaliatory tariffs against American goods as early as Tuesday, August 25. He indicated that imposing such tariffs appears to be the Canadian government's intention.

## Key Points
- Canada may introduce retaliatory tariffs on American goods
- Minister of Internal Trade Dominic LeBlanc suggested the announcement could come on Tuesday, August 25
- LeBlanc expressed that retaliatory tariffs are part of the government's intentions


